{
 "lines": [
  "Dussehre par poore India mein Ravan ko jalaya jaata hai.",
  "Par kuch jagah unki aarti bhi hoti hai!",
  "Dussehra matlab burai par achhai ki jeet.",
  "To Ravan ko koi kaise pooj sakta hai?",
  "Noida ke Bisrakh ko Ravan ka janmasthan maana jaata hai.",
  "Wahan Ravan ghar ghar ka beta hai.",
  "Mandsaur ko Mandodari ka maayka maana jaata hai.",
  "Matlab Ravan wahan ka damaad!",
  "Aur damaad ko koi jalata hai kya?",
  "Aap soch rahe ho bas ek-do gaon? Galat. List lambi hai.",
  "Kanpur mein ek mandir saal mein sirf ek din khulta hai...",
  "...Dussehre ke din.",
  "Wahan Ravan ko Shiv bhakt ki tarah pooja jaata hai.",
  "Baijnath mein maana jaata hai, Ravan ne yahin Shiv ji ki tapasya ki thi.",
  "Par Gadchiroli ke kuch Gond aadivasi Ravan ko apna purvaj maante hain.",
  "Ek hi kirdaar, alag jagah, alag parampara yahi India ki khoobsurti hai.",
  "Dussehre tak ye video share kar do taaki sabko pata chale",
  "aur aise hi videos ke liye subscribe karo Whysplained ko!"
 ],
